Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: Expected a value before this hole's closing `}`
  --> tests/ui/typed_text_hole_malformed.jet:4:24
    |
  4 |     page: HTML{"<p>{1 +}</p>"}
    |                        ^
 Why: A `{ }` hole holds one complete value
 Fix: Finish the value, for example `{a + b}`, or remove the hole
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
